## 👋 About Me
Hi, I’m **Alleanna Villan** — currently focused on **Data Engineering** with a background in **Financial Management**.  
I’m developing my skills in building **data pipelines**, **dimensional models**, **data cleaning**, **validation**, and **analytics**.  
My career goal is to pivot fully into **Data Engineering**, while continuing to explore **SQL, Python, Databricks, and Quality Assurance**.  

🌍 Based in the **Philippines**  
💡 Passionate about turning raw data into meaningful insights  

